{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":49,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by the sons of Korah."},{"n":1,"text":"Hear this, all you peoples. Listen, all you inhabitants of the world,","tok":[{"t":"Hear "},{"t":"this","s":["H1121"]},{"t":", all you peoples. Listen, all you inhabitants "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" world,"}]},{"n":2,"text":"both low and high, rich and poor together.","tok":[{"t":"both","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" low "},{"t":"and","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" high, rich "},{"t":"and","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" poor "},{"t":"together","s":["H8085"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"My mouth will speak words of wisdom. My heart will utter understanding.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" mouth "},{"t":"will","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" speak words "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" wisdom. "},{"t":"My","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" heart "},{"t":"will","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" utter understanding."}]},{"n":4,"text":"I will incline my ear to a proverb. I will solve my riddle on the harp.","tok":[{"t":"I","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" incline "},{"t":"my","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" ear "},{"t":"to","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" proverb. "},{"t":"I","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" solve "},{"t":"my","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" riddle "},{"t":"on","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1696"]},{"t":" harp."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Why should I fear in the days of evil, when iniquity at my heels surrounds me?","tok":[{"t":"Why should I fear "},{"t":"in","s":["H4912"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5186"]},{"t":" days "},{"t":"of","s":["H4912"]},{"t":" evil, when iniquity "},{"t":"at","s":["H2420"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H6605"]},{"t":" heels surrounds me?"}]},{"n":6,"text":"Those who trust in their wealth, and boast in the multitude of their riches—","tok":[{"t":"Those","s":["H5437"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H4100"]},{"t":" trust "},{"t":"in","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" wealth, "},{"t":"and","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" boast "},{"t":"in","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" multitude "},{"t":"of","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" riches—"}]},{"n":7,"text":"none of them can by any means redeem his brother, nor give God a ransom for him.","tok":[{"t":"none "},{"t":"of","s":["H7230"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"them","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" can "},{"t":"by","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" any means redeem "},{"t":"his","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" brother, nor "},{"t":"give","s":["H1984"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" ransom "},{"t":"for","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"him","s":["H5921"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"For the redemption of their life is costly, no payment is ever enough,","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"redemption","s":["H6299"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" life "},{"t":"is","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" costly, "},{"t":"no","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" payment "},{"t":"is","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ever","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" enough,"}]},{"n":9,"text":"that he should live on forever, that he should not see corruption.","tok":[{"t":"that","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" should live on "},{"t":"forever","s":["H5769"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"that","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" should "},{"t":"not","s":["H2308"]},{"t":" see corruption."}]},{"n":10,"text":"For he sees that wise men die; likewise the fool and the senseless perish, and leave their wealth to others.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H2421"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sees","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"that","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" wise men die; likewise "},{"t":"the","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" fool "},{"t":"and","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" senseless perish, "},{"t":"and","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"leave","s":["H2421"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wealth","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" others."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Their inward thought is that their houses will endure forever, and their dwelling places to all generations. They name their lands after themselves.","tok":[{"t":"Their","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" inward thought "},{"t":"is","s":["H3684"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"that","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" houses "},{"t":"will","s":["H2450"]},{"t":" endure forever, "},{"t":"and","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" dwelling places "},{"t":"to","s":["H4191"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"all","s":["H3162"]},{"t":" generations. "},{"t":"They","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" name "},{"t":"their","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" lands "},{"t":"after","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" themselves."}]},{"n":12,"text":"But man, despite his riches, doesn’t endure. He is like the animals that perish.","tok":[{"t":"But","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" man, "},{"t":"despite","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" riches, doesn’t "},{"t":"endure","s":["H5769"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"He","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" animals "},{"t":"that","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" perish."}]},{"n":13,"text":"This is the destiny of those who are foolish, and of those who approve their sayings. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"This","s":["H3885"]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"the","s":["H3885"]},{"t":" destiny of those who "},{"t":"are","s":["H1077"]},{"t":" foolish, "},{"t":"and","s":["H3366"]},{"t":" of those who approve their sayings. Selah."}]},{"n":14,"text":"They are appointed as a flock for Sheol. Death shall be their shepherd. The upright shall have dominion over them in the morning. Their beauty shall decay in Sheol, far from their mansion.","tok":[{"t":"They","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"are","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" appointed "},{"t":"as","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" flock "},{"t":"for","s":["H2088"]},{"t":" Sheol. Death "},{"t":"shall","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" shepherd. "},{"t":"The","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" upright "},{"t":"shall","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H2088"]},{"t":" dominion over "},{"t":"them","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"morning","s":["H2088"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Their","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" beauty "},{"t":"shall","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" decay "},{"t":"in","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" Sheol, far from "},{"t":"their","s":["H1870"]},{"t":" mansion."}]},{"n":15,"text":"But God will redeem my soul from the power of Sheol, for he will receive me. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"But God "},{"t":"will","s":["H3477"]},{"t":" redeem "},{"t":"my","s":["H7462"]},{"t":" soul "},{"t":"from","s":["H3477"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7462"]},{"t":" power "},{"t":"of","s":["H4194"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Sheol","s":["H7585"],"a":[5]},{"t":", "},{"t":"for","s":["H4194"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H1242"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H3477"]},{"t":" receive me. Selah."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Don’t be afraid when a man is made rich, when the glory of his house is increased;","tok":[{"t":"Don’t "},{"t":"be","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" afraid "},{"t":"when","s":["H3588"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"made","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" rich, "},{"t":"when","s":["H3588"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3588"],"a":[5]},{"t":" glory "},{"t":"of","s":["H3027"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" house "},{"t":"is","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" increased;"}]},{"n":17,"text":"for when he dies he will carry nothing away. His glory won’t descend after him.","tok":[{"t":"for","s":["H3588"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"when","s":["H3588"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H3588"],"a":[0]},{"t":" dies "},{"t":"he","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H1004"]},{"t":" carry nothing away. "},{"t":"His","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[8]},{"t":" won’t descend "},{"t":"after","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"him","s":["H7235"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Though while he lived he blessed his soul— and men praise you when you do well for yourself—","tok":[{"t":"Though","s":["H3588"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"while","s":["H3588"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H3588"],"a":[5]},{"t":" lived "},{"t":"he","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" blessed "},{"t":"his","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"soul","s":["H3519"]},{"t":"— "},{"t":"and","s":["H3381"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"men","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"praise","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"when","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"do","s":["H3381"]},{"t":" well "},{"t":"for","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" yourself—"}]},{"n":19,"text":"he shall go to the generation of his fathers. They shall never see the light.","tok":[{"t":"he","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shall","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"go","s":["H3190"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" generation "},{"t":"of","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H1288"]},{"t":" fathers. "},{"t":"They","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shall","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" never see "},{"t":"the","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" light."}]},{"n":20,"text":"A man who has riches without understanding, is like the animals that perish.","tok":[{"t":"A","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H3808"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"has","s":["H5331"]},{"t":" riches "},{"t":"without","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" understanding, "},{"t":"is","s":["H1755"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" animals "},{"t":"that","s":["H7200"]},{"t":" perish."}]}]}
